1
00:00:00,659 --> 00:00:02,439
(Howard:)You ready to talk about it?

2
00:00:02,594 --> 00:00:04,504
(Sheldon:)I'm not nearly drunk enough.

3
00:00:07,165 --> 00:00:08,505
(Raj:)Okay.

4
00:00:12,270 --> 00:00:13,810
(Sheldon:)Do you have any idea
what it's like to see

5
00:00:13,972 --> 00:00:15,812
(Sheldon:)your mother ravaging someone?

6
00:00:17,075 --> 00:00:18,615
(Howard:)Does a brisket count?

7
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:24,520
(Howard:)I'm sorry, buddy, that's rough.

8
00:00:24,683 --> 00:00:26,023
(Howard:)But didn't she know we were coming?

9
00:00:26,184 --> 00:00:28,924
(Sheldon:)No. I wanted to surprise her.

10
00:00:29,087 --> 00:00:32,037
(Sheldon:)What am I supposed to say to
her after something like this?

11
00:00:32,190 --> 00:00:34,100
(Howard:)Well, did she see you
in the window?

12
00:00:34,259 --> 00:00:35,829
(Raj:)-No.
-Then don't say anything.

13
00:00:37,262 --> 00:00:38,932
(Sheldon:)I have to.

14
00:00:39,097 --> 00:00:41,137
(Sheldon:)How can we ever hope to have
a healthy relationship

15
00:00:41,299 --> 00:00:42,969
(Sheldon:)if I don't tell her
how disappointed I am,

16
00:00:43,134 --> 00:00:44,674
(Sheldon:)and that I'll never forgive her?

17
00:00:46,538 --> 00:00:48,488
(Howard:)Well, don't do it on the phone.

18
00:00:48,640 --> 00:00:50,120
(Sheldon:)I'm just going
to tell her I'm coming

19
00:00:50,275 --> 00:00:52,845
(Sheldon:)so she can give that
"Good Time Charlie" the heave-ho.

20
00:00:54,646 --> 00:00:58,026
Thats some tough talk.
I may need to cut you off.

